;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "My_life_Without_Your_Love.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\診察室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Hmm, ideally you should have come in yesterday."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry... Even getting up was rough..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Still, food poisoning every year? You really need to be careful, okay?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes... I eat the same things as </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">my mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, but I guess my stomach's just weak."</STYLE><PG>
"For now I'll give you something for the nausea and some antibiotics. Are you going to school today?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, it's the entrance ceremony, so I figured I'd attend."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You left the opening ceremony early yesterday, didn't you?
{PAUSE ""}
　I don't think you should push yourself too hard. There aren't any classes today either, right?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But a junior I'm close with is giving the speech at the entrance ceremony..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, that'd be <STYLE ID="3">Erina Goto-san</STYLE>? You're close with <STYLE ID="3">her</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes. You know her too, Sensei?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, sure, <STYLE ID="3">Goto-san</STYLE> is a bit of a celebrity in Motoki-cho."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">She</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s made that much of a name for herself...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">After school I'm planning to go to the cherry-blossom festival with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE><PG>
"I wouldn't really recommend that... You'd be better off going home and sleeping, you know?
{PAUSE ""}
　You didn't get much sleep last night either, did you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But still, to celebrate her starting high school, I want to treat </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to at least a little something at the food stalls..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"My, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE>, you really are kind. 
{PAUSE ""}
You've been looking after <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> lately too, haven't you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Not really looking after her... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Being with her doesn't let me do anything for her, so I'm actually trying not to get in her way too much."</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE>, being considerate of the people around you like that is fine, but you have to take care of yourself too, okay?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE>, don't you think you care a little too much about the people around you?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't mean to... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But... now that you mention it, maybe you're right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I just really love them all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's one of your good points, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE>, but at least when you're feeling sick, think only about yourself. 
{PAUSE ""}
That's my advice as a doctor, okay?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Understood."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So... 
{PAUSE ""}
how are things on that other front?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Not yet. I guess it's an illness after all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's outside my specialty, so I can't really say, but this kind of thing varies from person to person. 
{PAUSE ""}
Try not to get too anxious about it."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay..."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
